   "widgets_values": [
    "## MiniMax H3 · keyframes along your camera\n\nThe **Director** draws the move. **Guide Frames** carries the anchor image along it, **Keyframes** picks one every 2 s on the H3 grid, and **H3 Guides** anchors them inside the generation with the core `MiniMaxH3AddGuide` - the same mechanism as the official *Multiframe Reference* template, driven by a camera instead of hand-placed images.\n\n- The anchor is also `<Picture 1>`, which holds identity and style.\n- **Camera → Prompt** adds the move in words.\n- Swap Guide Frames for a Feedback render or a Storyboard to guide with other images; connect an **audio** to H3 Guides to anchor a soundtrack at frame 0.\n- Model files follow the official template - swap for yours. Turbo LoRA: Ctrl+B, steps 4."
   ]
